\f0\fs24 \cf0 README - BALTIMORE, MD DATA FILES\
\
2019_shandasetal.pdf - A PDF of our paper in 
\i Climate 
\i0 presenting the data that you can download within this web portal. Baltimore, MD data are presented in Figure 3. \
\
Folder \'93TEMPERATURE SURFACES\'94 \
\
bal_af.tif- raster surface of predicted afternoon (3PM) ambient temperature presented in Figure 3C of Shandas et al., 2019\
\
bal_am.tif - raster surface of predicted morning (6AM) ambient temperature presented in Figure 3B of Shandas et al., 2019\
\
bal_pm.tif- raster surface of predicted evening (7PM) ambient temperature presented in Figure 3D of Shandas et al., 2019\
\
satellite_metadata.txt - text file containing Google Earth Engine code to extract Sentinel-2 satellite imagery used in modeling of the ambient temperature surfaces. See Shandas et al., 2019 for more information.\
\
Folder \'93VEHICLE TRAVERSE SHAPEFILES\'94\
\
trav_af.dbf, .prj, .shp, .shx - GIS shapefile of all vehicle traverse data (lat/lon/temperature) for the afternoon (3PM) driving time. These are \
\
trav_am.dbf, .prj, .shp, .shx - GIS shapefile of all vehicle traverse data (lat/lon/temperature) for the morning (6AM) driving time.\
\
trav_pm.dbf, .prj, .shp, .shx - GIS shapefile all vehicle traverse data (lat/lon/temperature) for the evening (7PM) driving time.\
